Breakfast & Brunch, Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3WU1ZobAqXQ07xYoKE2Vyg","review_id":"UAYbVkqfJIDyuLuSNAYQJw","date":"2012-05-04T15:54:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9312257766723633,"text_excerpt":"Went here for a late breakfast and it was very satisfying and started out the day nicely. Not to crowded and service was very friendly and attentive. Menu had good variety and was a challenge to narrow down an order. Decided to try the seafood omelette with shrimp and crawfish. And it was good. I tried the grits... got to remember to add butter and a little salt. :) Checking-in through yelp, I received a free sweet tea cocktail as well. Very refreshing. Mimosa is another good drink here. My friend got the Bloody Mary with crawfish granish.. looked very nice and she said it was strong and spicy. I'd recommend this place. With a few tvs and chill, dive feel, i'm a fan."},{"business_id":"3WU1ZobAqXQ07xYoKE2Vyg","review_id":"QMYB7lwuGUZc7S2Tvf72Wg","date":"2019-02-03T17:23:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9305719137191772,"text_excerpt":"Came in for a quick meal around midnight. We lucked up and got seated right away. This is not a fancy place but they have some good food and the food is very reasonably priced. They also serve breakfast all day The ragin cajun shrimp is a must have if you come here. Warning, they are very spicy but they taste amazing. I had a omolette with crawfish, mushrooms, and shrimp. It was just okay, not great. We went late night cause they are open 24 hours which I think is great. If you visit here expect to wait a while before being seated, cause there will probably be a line."},{"business_id":"3WU1ZobAqXQ07xYoKE2Vyg","review_id":"lmKvL22qz8g3cBMx9gM5yA","date":"2015-06-01T21:03:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9293028712272644,"text_excerpt":"We got into New Orleans quite late and asked at the hotel what was close for good food. They sent us to Daisy Dukes. Many thanks for that recommendation! This place is open 24 hours a day. I don't think it ever closes, and it serves breakfast all day, for those so inclined. I ordered the shrimp po-boy and the person I was with ordered gumbo. Everything tasted great! The shrimp were nicely seasoned, crunchy on the outside and tender inside. I would have happily skipped the bun and just eaten a plateful of the shrimp. This is clearly a place where locals eat, a bit of a hole-in-the-wall, and a great option anytime of the day or night."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3WU1ZobAqXQ07xYoKE2Vyg","photo_id":"GZcetQ_iVzQwtd128IKkLQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/GZcetQ_iVzQwtd128IKkLQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8642649054527283},{"business_id":"3WU1ZobAqXQ07xYoKE2Vyg","photo_id":"OPfqa-KtUnr45s3eFFPpTA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/OPfqa-KtUnr45s3eFFPpTA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8382651805877686},{"business_id":"3WU1ZobAqXQ07xYoKE2Vyg","photo_id":"vhcQ